# Coupert

> Official information about Coupert's shopping tools and their availability.

Coupert combines coupon discovery and testing, eligible Cash Back and price comparison. Supported products also offer price-history information and target-price alerts. Access is available through its website, browser extension and mobile app; features vary by store, device and region. The extension is free to install; optional Coupert Plus has separate paid terms.

